msgid "Inko-chan「WHEW......」"
msgstr "Inko-chan「UF......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh, I see you've calmed down,＿Inko-chan.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ah, veo que ya te calmaste, Inko-chan.」"

msgid "Inko-chan「OH YEAH...... HERE......」"
msgstr "Inko-chan「OH, SÍ...... TOMA......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Hm? It's one of your beloved sunflower＿seeds. Are you giving it to me?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Mm? Es una de tus queridas semillas＿de girasol. ¿Me la estás dando?」"

msgid "Inko-chan「GIVE...... FROM...... COLLECTION......」"
msgstr "Inko-chan「DOY...... DE MI...... COLECCIÓN......」"

msgid "Inko-chan「OH, GOOD」"
msgstr "Inko-chan「OH, BIEN」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Well, I'm going to bed. Good night,＿Inko-chan.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Bueno, me voy a dormir. Buenas＿noches, Inko-chan.」"

msgid "Inko-chan「NIGHT!」"
msgstr "Inko-chan「¡NOCHES!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「It's not exactly your collection. The one＿who gave them to you was none other＿than yours truly...... Well, whatever. I」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No es exactamente tu colección.＿Quien te las dio fue un servidor......＿Bueno, como sea. Yo」"

msgid "Ryuuji「accept your kind gesture.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「acepto tu amable gesto.」"
